## 2026-06-07 - US-001
- What was implemented: Added ARTICLE_FETCH_QUEUE producer+consumer to wrangler.jsonc (root, staging env, and production env queues blocks). Added ARTICLE_FETCH_QUEUE:Queue to the Env interface in src/server/index.ts and src/server/durable-objects/index.ts.
- Files changed: wrangler.jsonc, src/server/index.ts, src/server/durable-objects/index.ts
- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - The production env block in wrangler.jsonc does declare its own queues block, so it needed the new queue mirrored there too (using production queue names article-fetch-jobs / article-fetch-dlq, same as root).
  - Both Env interfaces (index.ts and DO/index.ts) needed the binding; DO's local Env omits the optional marker so Queue is non-optional there too.
