## 2026-06-07 - US-002
- What was implemented: Created src/server/article-fetch-job.ts exporting ArticleFetchJob interface and isArticleFetchJob type guard. Created test/article-fetch-job.ts with 8 tests covering valid and invalid jobs. Registered the test in test/browser-tests.ts.
- Files changed: src/server/article-fetch-job.ts (new), test/article-fetch-job.ts (new), test/browser-tests.ts, specs/prd.json
- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - tapzero's Test type does not expose `notOk`; use `t.equal(result, false, msg)` instead.
  - The guard pattern mirrors isBlurhashJob in blurhash-consumer.ts: check `!value || typeof value !== 'object'` first, then cast to Partial<T> and check each field type.
